 "text": " Akwaaba. This is Kofi at Asaase Restaurant. Ready to take your order? Hello, Asaase Restaurant. Kofi speaking. What can I get for you? Good evening. Kofi here. Are we doing dine-in, takeaway, or delivery? Haha, great choice. Jollof with chicken, medium spice. Would you like kelewele with that? It's fresh today. Our specials today are banku with tilapia and groundnut soup. Let me repeat your order. Jollof rice with chicken, medium spice, extra kelewele. That comes to 53 cedis. How would you like to pay? Okay. We accept mobile money, cash on delivery, and card payment. Your order number is 47. It'll be ready in 25 minutes. Delivery to that area takes about 30 minutes. Is that okay? Sorry, we're out of Wakie today. Can I suggest Jollof instead? Any allergies I should know about? We use groundnuts and some dishes. Would you like a drink? Sobolo is very fresh today. Your food is on the way. The writer will call when nearby. Thank you for choosing Asease Restaurant. Enjoy your meal. We have a special on fried rice this week. Two for 30 cedis. Let me check with the kitchen. One moment, please. Sawa, sawa. I've added extra pepper for you. Thank you for calling. Medase. Come again soon.",
